### 1. LOGIN (Esto guardará el token automáticamente en la memoria de IntelliJ)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@dismal.net",
  "password": "password456"
}

> {% client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. CREAR PRODUCTO (Windows 11 Pro)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/store/product
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Windows 11 Pro",
  "description": "Licencia Retail Original para 1 PC",
  "price": 25.50,
  "platform": "PC",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/win11.jpg"
}

> {% client.global.set("product_id", response.body.id); %}

### 3. VER TODOS LOS PRODUCTOS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/store/products
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
### 4. CREAR META FINANCIERA (Para Windows 11)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/store/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "softwareId": "{{product_id}}",
  "targetUnits": 1000,
  "variableCost": 5.00,
  "fixedCosts": 300.00,
  "deadline": "2025-12-31"
}

### 5. VER METAS (Y ver si calculó el Punto de Equilibrio)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/store/goals?softwareId={{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}